    "origin": "OpenKal compatibility decisions based on independent local renderer observations of optional user-supplied models. No model or texture data is redistributed.",
    "compatibility_policy": "OpenKal defines its own one-hand/two-hand compatibility assignments where reference categories are unverified. Strict actual-weapon matching remains required.",
    "scope": "These choices specify OpenKal cosmetic compatibility, not reference item categories. Standalone grips and sampled one-hand/two-hand attack views were compared; names, model numbering, variant parity and fingerprints do not infer a category.",
    "review": "All assignments receive subsequent idle/walk and sampled attack-variant checks. This does not establish complete animation, effect, collision or live-game correctness."
